{"event_type":"review","id":"6159d5dc11c450fda983349cb3497d57658e642505c456501757be65153b143e","occurred_at":"2026-11-13T23:38:58Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/62b6592168304ff85fe45c5f9f2ad4d1b5f169cdcdebe9a5a898b35f9c0469b2","sha256":"62b6592168304ff85fe45c5f9f2ad4d1b5f169cdcdebe9a5a898b35f9c0469b2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d131cf9a97a0d19591fee0069839cd5ddd49f42e65351171cbd1dc1c89a528ee","sha256":"d131cf9a97a0d19591fee0069839cd5ddd49f42e65351171cbd1dc1c89a528ee"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e68c40c32d711b81a8cd86392db30c58447b707ed1abde70bade1315419fee4a","sha256":"e68c40c32d711b81a8cd86392db30c58447b707ed1abde70bade1315419fee4a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e8dfc44d81963fa0596003fee028886a538aafe6ccfa19f7383cc3cb899e1d41","sha256":"e8dfc44d81963fa0596003fee028886a538aafe6ccfa19f7383cc3cb899e1d41"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/06f10df0d76f878df9fbda710c4d71bb10fb4076a90578f9cca27a078684dfc2","sha256":"06f10df0d76f878df9fbda710c4d71bb10fb4076a90578f9cca27a078684dfc2"}],"attempt_id":"e3942eafc0fe7290cf959f793052090235ea475b81d2e0a1ed3893dbbe9e9753:0:1","base":"ec8e7f6598fdb63eb0e751d1ce92450e06825cdf","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"201579c54430da2dd3921bee7c675c91ba7d03d3","body":"**Check the effective `ExecStart` in the completion port, not only the fragment bytes.**\n\n`SystemdJournalCompletionPort._service` (`apps/crq-python/ops/unit-completion.py:511-521`) checks the runtime and SHA-256 digest of the main unit file only. `_show` (`unit-completion.py:473-476`) does not request `ExecStart` or `DropInPaths`. systemd merges drop-in files after the main unit file, and a drop-in can reset `ExecStart=`. The main file can therefore match the digest while a different command runs. The completion port can then report a successful invocation for a runtime that did not run. ([freedesktop.org](https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/257/systemd.unit.html))\n\nThe existing unexpected-drop-in check (`unit-switch-adapter.py:509-515`) scans only the declared drop-in directory. It does not cover drop-ins in the other systemd search paths. Add the effective-command check to the completion port. Compare the effective `ExecStart` from `systemctl show` with the expected rendered command, or reject drop-ins that set `ExecStart`. Keep the declared repair drop-in accepted when it sets only `Requires=` and `After=`.","id":"8a639a59f99a7aa66e30cccf5f4da28cb9b554038b96ac123c59b735d8a194fd","intervals":[[517,520]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-completion.py","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Check the effective `ExecStart` in the completion port, not only the fragment bytes."}],"head":"df0f17ddc588e63c23c569baade646e415560396","head_tree":"7e3bc6040d8da1acb2564424b853efe795537180","input_scope":[{"blob":"201579c54430da2dd3921bee7c675c91ba7d03d3","intervals":[[1,713]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-completion.py"},{"blob":"20d74f0448beb3d9366e4104760558583f864fce","intervals":[[1,888]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/vm-unit-switch-guest-partial.py"}],"job_id":"e3942eafc0fe7290cf959f793052090235ea475b81d2e0a1ed3893dbbe9e9753:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"201579c54430da2dd3921bee7c675c91ba7d03d3","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-completion.py","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"20d74f0448beb3d9366e4104760558583f864fce","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/ops/vm-unit-switch-guest-partial.py","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"e